{
  "id": 440230690,
  "iid": 22739,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix some incorrect uses of -1 as offset",
  "description": "In gpef, this is apparently meant to be an item covering the entire tvb.\n\nIn RTP ED137, these are apparently meant to create a generated item one\nbyte back out of the subset tvb into the parent tvbuff. It doesn't work\nthat way, so just make it a zero offset, zero length generated item for\nnow.\n\nPing #20103",
